<title>UK: Logica H1 pretax profit up 18 pct.</title>
<headline>Logica H1 pretax profit up 18 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		11.7		   vs 9.8</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 3.6		    vs 3.0</p>
<p> Pretax		     10.6		   vs 9.0</p>
<p> Turnover		   147.9		  vs 128.9</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the British software group is Logica Plc .</p>
